---
import { heroRotator, contact } from '../data/site';

const whatsappUrl = `https://wa.me/${contact.whatsapp}`;

// Static words revealed on load via the word-mask intro animation.
const line1 = ['Hacemos', 'que'];
const line2 = ['tu', 'marca'];
---

<section id="top" class="relative flex min-h-screen flex-col justify-center px-6 pt-28 pb-16 lg:px-10">
  <div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-7xl">
    <p class="reveal mb-6 flex items-center gap-3 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-muted">
      <span class="inline-block h-px w-10 bg-lime"></span>
      Estudio de marketing digital · AR
    </p>

    <h1 class="font-display text-display lowercase">
      <span class="block font-light text-ink/90">
        {line1.map((w) => (
          <span class="word-mask mr-[0.25em]"><span>{w}</span></span>
        ))}
      </span>
      <span class="block font-light text-ink/90">
        {line2.map((w) => (
          <span class="word-mask mr-[0.25em]"><span>{w}</span></span>
        ))}
        <span class="inline-flex items-baseline align-top">
          <span
            data-typewriter={JSON.stringify(heroRotator)}
            class="bg-gradient-to-r from-violet via-cyan to-lime bg-clip-text font-semibold text-transparent"
            >{heroRotator[0]}</span
          ><span data-caret aria-hidden="true" class="caret ml-1 font-light text-cyan">|</span>
        </span>
      </span>
    </h1>

    <p class="reveal mt-8 max-w-xl text-lead text-muted">
      Somos HACKS. Estrategia, contenido y pauta que llevan tu marca a otra órbita.
      Del social al e-commerce, hacemos que cada acción sume a tu negocio.
    </p>

    <div class="reveal mt-10 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4">
      <a
        href={whatsappUrl}
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener"
        data-magnetic="0.4"
        class="group inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-lime px-7 py-3.5 font-display font-semibold text-space transition-transform hover:scale-[1.03]"
      >
        Despeguemos juntos
        <span class="transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:translate-x-1">→</span>
      </a>
      <a
        href="#servicios"
        class="link-underline inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-2 py-3.5 font-medium text-ink"
      >
        Ver servicios
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <a
    href="#servicios"
    aria-label="Bajar a servicios"
    class="absolute bottom-8 left-1/2 hidden -translate-x-1/2 flex-col items-center gap-2 text-muted md:flex"
  >
    <span class="text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.3em]">Scroll</span>
    <span class="flex h-9 w-5 justify-center rounded-full border border-white/20 p-1">
      <span class="h-1.5 w-1 animate-bounce rounded-full bg-lime"></span>
    </span>
  </a>
</section>
